<h2><font color=#800000>The Scourge</font> | EVENTS</h2>
click <a href=/TheScourge/addevent.shtml>here</a> to add a new event.<p>
<table width=100% cols=2 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 border=1 bordercolor=#000000>
<tr bgcolor=#800000><td align=center width=35%><font color=#ffffff><b> &nbsp; August 5, 2000 - 8:00 pm</td><td align=left width=65%><font color=#c0c0c0><b><i> &nbsp; Guild Duelist Championship</td></tr>
<tr bgcolor=#AAAAAA><td width=80% colspan=2><font color=#000000>
The time of this event is EST. <br><br>The event is open to all levels, and prizes will be distributed for winners of each class. , Constellation prizes will be awarded when all victors have been paid their due. <br><br>This tournament will be regulated non-twink. , A test of skills, not gear! , Bank your gear before coming, you all will be distributed with the lowest grade of rusty weapons. <br><br>The tournament is to be held in the Arena in Lake Rathetear. , So Naturall and perhaps an old friend Spur might be able to help with TP's, invis and binds. <br><br>Please pass this information along to all other members who are in the guild, and have yet to add their characters to the members list of this web page (as this email is only being sent to those who registered their characters) <br><br>All questions and concerned may be directed to the newly added "Guild Events" forum on the website. <br><br>Thanks! , Scourge On!
</td></tr>
